sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OW as /api/v1/ocr/workers/:id/*
    participant WK as ocr-worker<br/>heartbeat, claim, fetch, extract, submit
    participant CO as OcrCoordinator<br/>(in-API sweep, 15 s)
    participant ST as storage volume
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    loop ocr-worker pull loop
        WK->>OW: POST heartbeat (status)
        WK->>OW: POST claim
        OW->>CO: oldest pending chunk (or lease-expired), SKIP LOCKED
        CO->>DB: chunk → claimed, lease 300 s, attempts+1
        CO-->>WK: {chunk id, page range}
    end

    WK->>OW: GET source/:chunkId
    OW->>ST: read source bytes
    ST-->>WK: file bytes
    WK->>WK: PyMuPDF text pass → PaddleOCR fallback

    alt success
        WK->>OW: POST result {pages[], text}
        CO->>CO: validate page range vs chunk
        CO->>DB: chunk → submitted
        alt totalPages > end
            CO->>DB: materialize remaining chunks (missing indexes)
        end
    else failure
        WK->>OW: POST fail {error, permanent}
        CO->>CO: attempts < MAX=3 → pending (retry)
    end

    CO->>DB: chunks contiguous 1..N ⇒ persist text
    CO->>DB: material READY, job completed
    Note over DB: Expired leases reclaimed —<br/>terminal failure after 3 attempts.